## Why exporting, importing or adding a file failed.

errors-bundle-newer = It was made by a newer version of NotIn Plus. Update the app and try again.
errors-bundle-damaged = The file is incomplete or damaged.
errors-readable-zip = Couldn't build the zip file. Try again.
errors-file-picker = The file picker couldn't open. Try again.
errors-export-stopped = The export stopped before it finished. Try again.
